$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step 1. 100 ml RB flask was charged with
(R)-2'-bromo-7'-iodo-5H-spiro[oxazole-4,9'-xanthen]-2-amine ((R)-6b)(3.3
g, 7.22 mmol), pyrimidin-5-ylboronic acid (1.163 g, 9.39 mmol), and
tetrakis(triphenylphosphine)palladium(0) (0.834 g, 0.722 mmol). DME (50
mL) followed by sodium carbonate (10.83 mL, 21.66 mmol) (2M solution)
were added and the mixture was heated at 70°C for 24 hrs. The mixture was
diluted with water and ethyl acetate, filtered and organic layer was
separated and concentrated. The crude material was purified by FC on 80 g
RediSep column using 5-70% gradient of DCM/MeOH/NH4OH in DCM.
(S)-2'-bromo-7'-(pyrimidin-5-yl)-5H-spiro[oxazole-4,9'-xanthen]-2-amine
(1.82 g, 4.45 mmol, 62% yield). 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ ppm 9.18 (s,
1 H), 9.10 (s, 2 H), 9.03 - 9.12 (m, 2 H), 7.78 (dd, J=8.5, 2.2 Hz, 1 H),
7.69 (d, J=2.2 Hz, 1 H), 7.53 (dd, J=8.7, 2.4 Hz, 1 H), 7.41 (d, J=2.3
Hz, 1 H), 7.33 (d, J=8.4 Hz, 1 H), 7.19 (d, J=8.8 Hz, 1 H), 6.54 (s, 2
H), 4.20 - 4.31 (m, 2 H). MS m/z = 409.0 and 411.0 [M+H]+.
