Gisselbrecht, Jean-Paul; Ruffieux, Pascal; Fasel, Roman; Muellen, Klaus
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2013), 135(11), 4550-4557

