$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of Compound trans-2. Compound 8 (0.55 g, 1 mmol), 11 (1.7 g, 3
mmol), and ground K2CO3 (0.28 g, 2 mmol) were dissolved in dry
1,4-dioxane (10 mL). The mixture was degassed for 15 min, and Pd(PPh3)4
(0.058 g, 0.05 mmol) was then added. The dark brown mixture was heated to
reflux under an atomosphere of Ar for 24 h. The reaction mixture was
concentrated in vacuo, and water (50 mL) was added. The brown solid was
filtered, washed with water, dried overnight, and purified by
chromatography on silica gel using CH2Cl2/MeOH (20:1). Yellow solid,
yield (0.58 g, 53%). Mp = 106-107 °C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CD2Cl2, 298 K): δ
= 8.16 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H), 7.91 (d, J = 1.6 Hz, 2H), 7.69 (dd, J = 8.9,
2.7 Hz, 4H), 7.22 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 4H), 7.01 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 2H), 6.92 (d,
J = 8.3 Hz, 2H), 6.80 (s, 8H), 4.11 (m, 18H), 3.99 (d, J = 9.5 Hz, 2H),
3.84-3.75 (m, 8H), 3.69 (d, J = 11.2 Hz, 8H), 2.74 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H),
1.08 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 6H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3, 298 K): δ = 152.2,
149.2, 148.9, 148.5, 135.7, 134.4, 131.3, 131.2, 129.3, 125.7, 125.7,
125.1, 121.4, 120.1, 118.6, 114.4, 114.2, 114.1, 113.3, 74.1, 71.3, 69.9,
69.7, 69.5, 69.4, 69.4, 32.9, 29.7, 13.9 HRMS (ESI) m/z: [M + Na]+ calcd
for C76H84NaO18 1307.5550, found 1307.5563.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Photodriven Clamlike Motion in a [3]Rotaxane with Two [2]Rotaxane Arms
Bridged by an Overcrowded Alkene Switch
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Zhou, Wei; Guo, Ya-Jing; Qu, Da-Hui
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2013), 78(2), 590-596

